----                             2482  ; Overflow exits report the start column of the token that could not be fully  ; [section code]
----                             2483  ; materialized. This matches the Rust-side behavior of attributing capacity  ; [section code]
----                             2484  ; failures to the token currently being scanned rather than the following byte.  ; [section code]
